# Cloudflare Workers static-assets redirects. Copied verbatim into dist/ by
# Astro's public/ handling, and evaluated at the edge before asset serving.
#
# Real 301s, deliberately not Astro's static `redirects:` config — that emits a
# meta-refresh HTML page, which is not a server redirect and does not pass
# ranking signals.
#
# Doorway consolidation: each of these routes rendered the *same island with the
# same props* as its target, so it was a second address for one tool rather than
# a distinct tool. Both source forms are listed because Cloudflare may normalise
# the slash-less path to the directory form before redirects are matched.
#
#   /json-editor       === /json-formatter  (both ToolPage variant="format")
#   /json-graph-viewer === /json-visualizer (both <JsonGraphViewer />, no props)

/json-editor          /json-formatter/    301
/json-editor/         /json-formatter/    301
/json-graph-viewer    /json-visualizer/   301
/json-graph-viewer/   /json-visualizer/   301
